flowchart TD
    A[📂 ERP System Logs] --> B[📖 Read Log File]
    B --> C[🔄 Preprocess Logs]
    
    C --> C1[Filter INFO<br/>Keep ERROR & WARN]
    C1 --> C2[Compress 80%<br/>Extract Error Patterns]
    C2 --> D[🔍 Generate Fingerprint]
    
    D --> E{💾 Check Cache}
    
    E -->|Cache HIT| F[♻️ Load Cached Report]
    E -->|Cache MISS| G[🤖 Call OpenRouter API]
    
    G --> H[📊 Generate Structured Report]
    H --> I[💾 Save to Cache]
    I --> J[📄 Output Report]
    F --> J
    
    J --> K[🖥️ Display on Screen]
    J --> L[💾 Archive to reports/]
    
    K --> M[📋 Executive Summary]
    K --> N[📊 Log Statistics]
    K --> O[🚨 Critical Issues]
    K --> P[🎯 Priority Ranking]
    K --> Q[🔧 Actionable Recommendations]